  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.1: documentation and packaging patch - every public member now carries XML documentation (CS1591 is enforced as a build error) and the README was reviewed for accuracy. Previous release: v2.0.0 - the ambient tenant is no longer auto-created. TryGet/Require are separate and ITenantScope guarantees a deterministic reset. Tenant id is propagated through outbox message headers. Full documentation & release notes: https://quoclinh.id.vn/docs/linkit",
